{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0373.1", "text": "756-742 ΙΩΑΝΝΟΥ ΑΡΧΙΕΠΙΣΚΟΠΟΥ ΚΩΝΣΤΑΝΤΙΝΟΥΠΟΛΕΩΣ"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0373.2", "text": "ἐκ τῆς πρὸς Καισάριον μοναχὸν ἐπιστολῆς μετὰ τὴν δευτέραν αὐτοῦ ἐξορίαν."}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0374.1", "text": "Καὶ φήσεις πάντως ἐκ πλάνης πρὸς τὸ κρεῖττον ἐληλυθέναι, καὶ χάριν ὁμολογεῖν τοῖς τὴν θαυμαστὴν ἐκείνην προκομίσαι βίβλον, ἣν ἀρίστην τὰ κάλλιστα σου ἀποκαλοῦσι γράμματα, ὡς τηλαυγῶς [743] διαγορεύουσαν τὴν συνδρομὴν οὐσιώδη καὶ μίξιν θεοπσιαν γενεσθαι θεότητός τε καὶ σαρκός, μίαν τε ἀντεῦθεν ἀποτελεσθῆναι φύσιν. Τοῦτο, θαυμάσιε, τοῦ παράφρονος Ἀποлинаρίου τὸ ἀτόπημα· αὕτη τῶν εἰσαγόντων κράσιν καὶ συναλοιφὴν ἡ δυσσεβεστάτη αἵρεσις."}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0374.2", "text": "μὲν σαρκί, ἀπαθὴς δὲ θεότητι. Ταῦτα δὲ καὶ ἐπὶ τοῦ Υἱοῦ καὶ Ἰησοῦ καὶ Κυρίου κατηγορεῖται· κοινὰ γὰρ ταῦτα, καὶ δεικτικὰ τῶν δύο οὐσιῶν τὰ ὀνόματα,"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0374.3", "text": "Χριστὸν δὲ ὅταν εἴπης, συνήφας ἐκάτερα· ὅθεν καὶ παθητὸς λέγοιτο ἂν ὁ αὐτὸς καὶ ἀπαθής· παθητὸς"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0374.4", "text": "[744] Οὕτω καὶ ἐνταῦθα τῆς θείας ἐνιδρυμένης τῷ σώματι φύσεως, ἕνα Υἱόν, ἕν πρόσωπον τὸ συναμφότερον ἀπετέλεσαν. Γνωριζόμενον μὲντοι ἀσυγχύτως ἀδιαίρετόν· λόγῳ, οὐχ ἐν μιᾷ μόνῃ φύσει, ἀλλ' ἐν δυσὶ τελείαις. Ἐπὶ γὰρ μιᾶς πῶς τὸ ἀσύγχυτον; πῶς τὸ ἀδιαίρετον; πῶς ἕνωσις λεχθεῖν ποτέ; Ἐαυτὴ γὰρ"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.1", "text": "τὴν μίαν ἑνούσθαι, ἢ συγχεῖσθαι, ἢ διαιρεῖσθαι,"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.2", "text": "ἀδύνατον. Ποῖος οὖν ἄξιος ἐξηρεύξατο μίαν ἐπὶ Χρι-"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.3", "text": "στῷ λέγειν φύσιν; ἡ γὰρ τὴν θείαν φύσιν κρατοῦν-"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.4", "text": "τες τὴν ἀνθρωπίνην ἀρνοῦνται, φημὶ τὴν ἡμετέραν"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.5", "text": "σωτηρίαν· ἢ τὴν ἀνθρωπίνην κατέχοντες τῆς θείας"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.6", "text": "φύσεως τὴν ἄρνησιν ποιοῦνται· ἐπεὶ λεγέτωσαν, ποία"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.7", "text": "ἀπολώλεχε τὸ ἴδιον; Εἰ γὰρ ἐπὶ ἐρρωται ἡ ἕνωσις,"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.8", "text": "πάντως καὶ μετὰ τῆς ἑνώσεως ἰδιώματα ἀποψύξεσθαι"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.9", "text": "ἀνάγκη, ἐπεὶ οὐχ ἕνωσις τοῦτο, ἀλλὰ σύγχυσις καὶ"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.10", "text": "ἀφανισμὸς τῶν φύσεων."}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.11", "text": "745 Πάλιν εἰς ἄλλο μεταπηδόντες φασί, μετὰ τὴν"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.12", "text": "ἕνωσιν μὴ χρήναι λέγειν δύο φύσεις. Πρόσεχε τῇ"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.13", "text": "σημασίᾳ τοῦ ῥήτου. Ἑνωσιν εἴπας; Ἑνωσιν δὲ μιᾶς"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.14", "text": "οὐκ ἂν εὑροὶς γινόμενην."}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.15", "text": "Εἰώθασί δὲ καὶ τοῦτο προτείνειν Ἄρα οὐ τὸ σῶμα"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.16", "text": "καὶ αἷμα τοῦ Θεοῦ λαμβάνομεν πιστῶς καὶ εὐσεβῶς;"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.17", "text": "Ναὶ λεκτέον, οὐχ ὅτι τὸ σῶμα καὶ αἷμα τὸ θεῖον πρὸ τῆς"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.18", "text": "ἐνανθρωπήσεως ἐκέχθη φύσει, ἀλλ᾽ ἐπειδὴ τὰ τῆς"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.19", "text": "σαρκὸς ἰδιοποιεῖται, ἔχειν λέγεται ταῦτα. Ὦ τοῦ"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.20", "text": "ἀτοπήματος! Ὦ τῆς ἀσεβοῦς διανοίας! Κινδυνεύει"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.21", "text": "γὰρ παρ᾽ αὐτοῖς[τῷ] τῆς θεότητος ἀξίωμα. Καὶ πάλιν"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.22", "text": "τὸ Κυριακὸν σῶμα ὡς ἀληθινὸν σῶμα ὁμολογεῖν οὐκ"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.23", "text": "ἀνέχονται. Δι᾽ ἐπινοίας γὰρ λέξεων τετράφθαι τοῦτο"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.24", "text": "εἰς θεότητα φαντάζονται, μίαν ἐντεῦθεν κατασκευα-"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.25", "text": "ζόντες φύσιν, καὶ αὐτὴν τίνος εἶναι μὴ εὑρίσκοντες"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.26", "text": "λέγειν."}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.27", "text": "Τούτων τὰς κενοφωνίας ἐκκλινόντες, ἀγαπητέ, εἰς"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.28", "text": "τὸ προκείμενον ἐπανελθῶμεν, εὐσεβῶς καὶ λίαν εὐ-"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.29", "text": "σεβῶς τὸν θανάτῳ περιβεβημένον Χριστὸν ὁμολογεῖν ἐν"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.30", "text": "θεότητι τέλειον, καὶ ἐν ἀνθρωπότητι τέλειον, ἕνα"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.31", "text": "Υἱὸν μονογενῆ, οὐ διαιρούμενον εἰς υἱῶν δυάδα,"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.32", "text": "φέροντα δ᾽ ὅμως ἐν ἑαυτῷ τῶν ἀχωρίστων δύο φύ-"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.33", "text": "σεων ἀσυγχύτους ἰδιότητας· οὐχ ἄλλον καὶ ἄλλον, μὴ"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.34", "text": "γένοιτο, ἀλλ᾽ ἕνα καὶ τὸν αὐτὸν Κύριον Ἰησοῦν Χρι-"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.35", "text": "στὸν Θεοῦ Λόγον, σάρκα ἡμῖν ἐσμένον, καὶ αὐτὴν οὐκ"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.36", "text": "ἀψυχον καὶ ἄνουν, ὡς ὁ δυσσεβὴς [746] Ἀπολινάριος"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.37", "text": "εἴπεν. Τούτοις τοίνυν πρόσχωμεν· φύγωμεν τοὺς"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.38", "text": "διαιροῦντας. Εἰ γὰρ καὶ διττὴ ἡ φύσις, ἀλλ᾽ οὐν ἀδιαί-"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.39", "text": "ρετος καὶ ἀδιάσπαστος ἡ ἕνωσις, ἣν ἐν ἐνὶ τῷ τῆς"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.40", "text": "υἱότητος ὁμολογοῦμεν προσώπῳ, καὶ μιᾷ ὑποστάσει."}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.41", "text": "Φύγωμεν τοὺς μίαν φύσιν μετὰ τὴν ἕνωσιν τερατεύου-"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.42", "text": "μένους· τῇ γὰρ τῆς μιᾶς ἐπινοίᾳ τῷ ἀπαθεῖ Θεῷ"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.43", "text": "πάθος προσάπτειν ἐπείγονται, τὴν οἰκονομίαν ἀρ-"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.44", "text": "νοῦμενοι, καὶ τοῦ διαβόλου τὴν γένναν προσαρπάζ-"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.45", "text": "ζοντες. Ταῦτα διὰ τὸ μέτρον τῆς ἐπιστολῆς ἀρκεῖν"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.46", "text": "εἰς ἀσφάλειαν ἡγοῦμαι τῆς σῆς ἀγάπης, θαυμάσιε."}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.47", "text": "legit ἡ ἕνωσις ἐν ἐνὶ τῆς υἱότητος ὁμολογοῦμενος προσώπῳ,"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.48", "text": "καὶ μιᾷ ὑποστάσει.</note>"}
{"urn": "joannes-chrysostomus.epistula-ad-caesarium-sp", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg052_0377.49", "text": "γὰρ καὶ διττὴ... ἀδιάσπαστος ἡ ἐν. ἐν ἐνὶ τῆς υἱότητος ὁμολο-"}
